That's how you generate
the first row of

40
00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:41.690
this table with
orange juice one.

41
00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:44.010
Then to generate the
negative examples,

42
00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:46.050
you're going to take the
same context word and

