00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.730
To summarize the way we

59
00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:35.735
generated this
dataset is we'll pick

60
00:02:35.735 --> 00:02:40.090
a context word and then
pick a target word

61
00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:45.015
and that is the first
row of this table,

62
00:02:45.015 --> 00:02:46.800
that gives us a
positive example.

63
00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:50.305
Context target, and then
give that a label of one.

64
00:02:50.305 --> 00:02:53.110
Then what we do is for
some number of times,

65
00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:56.150
say k times, we're going to take

66
00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:57.770
the same context words and

67
00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:59.960
